          "message": "[FIX] stock: report delivery are shown correctly.\n\nif you add information in the client_order_ref field it breaks the report, also it will be homogenized with the sales and invoice reports.\n\ncloses odoo/odoo#172366\n\nSigned-off-by: Valeriya Chuprina (vchu) <vchu@odoo.com>",
