        "body": "# Version Number\r\n`4.0.0`\r\n\r\n# Bugfix or Enhancement\r\nPossibly incorrect documentation\r\n\r\n# Description\r\nDocs for `y1-motor` harness define wire gauge as 22 AWG [here](https://github.com/opulo-inc/lumenpnp/blame/3c33793efe5a9135383f3ad1314b21d5177043fd/pnp/cad/CHA/y1-motor/y1-motor.yml#L29). Since all the other wire harnesses use 24 AWG, this looks like it could be a mistake.\r\n![y1-motor](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a1463625-bc50-40c8-8c49-3776e2a5484b)\r\n\r\n# Suggested Solution\r\nIf this is a mistake, change gauge to 24 AWG\r\n",
